  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "DotCov 4.6.0 prevents the tool pointer from becoming available before its runtime packages can be downloaded.\nThe release workflow verifies public package indexes, registration, downloads and source commits before publishing the pointer, then installs and exercises the public native tool before creating the GitHub Release.\nKeeps bounded availability waits, retained diagnostics, all existing test and coverage gates, and the 4.5.0 branch ownership fix. CLI commands, JSON and exit codes are unchanged.\nFull notes: https://github.com/ANcpLua/dotcov/blob/main/docs/releases/4.6.0.md",
